    "text": "Feb. 13, 2025: 7:50 p.m.:\nU.S. Environmental Protection Agency Administrator Lee Zeldin gives an accounting of recently discovered taxpayer ‘gold bars‘\nZeldin promises that the financial agent agreement with bank will be instantly terminated, the bank will return all funds, EPA will reassume responsibility for all of the funds, review every penny that has gone out the door, he’ll refer the matter to the inspector general’s office, and he’ll will work with the justice department on this matter.\n— Elon Musk (@elonmusk)\n[February 13, 2025]",
